        "charset/parsing exceptions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "stream body",
      "result": "Response.close closes raw for an unconsumed body and calls release_conn. Completed iter_content marks content consumed and still releases the connection. urllib3 closes exceptional connections; returning to a closed pool closes/discards the connection."
    },
    {
      "path": "exception before Response creation",
      "result": "requests.api.request uses with Session; TLS/connect failures leave through Session.__exit__ -> close -> HTTPAdapter.close, clearing normal and proxy pools."
    },
    {
      "path": "no GET policy/circuit stop",
      "result": "raw_get/capture_one return metadata before constructing any HTTP Response; no live Response is cached. Robot cache and redirect lists store dictionaries, not Response objects."
    },
    {
      "path": "wrapper child completion",
      "result": "stdout log is opened with a context manager around Popen/wait; after wait the child reference is cleared and the log handle closes. An exited collector process cannot retain its open descriptors."
    },
    {
      "path": "cross-GET connection reuse",
      "result": "Module-level requests.get creates/closes a temporary Session on every call. Cross-GET pool reuse is absent. This is connection churn, not evidence of a leak or a proved explanation for shared503."
    }
  ],
